message: "Cite the exact ETP software release or commit that you used."
title: "Effect Transaction Protocol"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Medjani"
    given-names: "Bilal"
version: "0.1.0-alpha.1"
repository-code: "https://github.com/billmedj/etp"
url: "https://github.com/billmedj/etp"
license: "Apache-2.0"
abstract: >-
  Effect Transaction Protocol defines a transaction boundary for external
  effects proposed by untrusted agents. It binds a typed proposal to an
  authorization decision, current-state checks, a single-use execution grant,
  an outcome receipt, and append-only reconciliation.
keywords:
  - autonomous agents
  - execution integrity
  - transactional authorization
  - effect protocol
  - single-use grants
  - reconciliation
